@Lab_25_26_Architecture_HostAddress = http://localhost:5281
@HttpsAddress = https://localhost:7021

### 1. Get All Users (Via Service -> Repository)
GET {{Lab_25_26_Architecture_HostAddress}}/api/User/GetAll
Accept: application/json

###

### 2. Get User By ID (Via Service -> Repository)
GET {{Lab_25_26_Architecture_HostAddress}}/api/User/GetById/1
Accept: application/json

###

### 3. Add User (College Practical Requirement: Controller -> Validator -> Service -> Repository)
POST {{Lab_25_26_Architecture_HostAddress}}/api/User/Add
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userTypeID": 3,
  "fullName": "Student Demo",
  "userCode": "STD999",
  "email": "student999@college.edu",
  "password": "Password@123",
  "mobileNumber": "9876543210",
  "profilePicturePath": "/Files/Users/std999.png"
}

###

### 4. Add User with Validation Failure (Triggers FluentValidation in Controller)
POST {{Lab_25_26_Architecture_HostAddress}}/api/User/Add
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userTypeID": 99,
  "fullName": "",
  "userCode": "STD999",
  "email": "invalid-email",
  "password": "123",
  "mobileNumber": "123"
}

###

### 5. Update User (Via Service -> Repository)
PUT {{Lab_25_26_Architecture_HostAddress}}/api/User/Update/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userTypeID": 1,
  "fullName": "Madhuresh Shah (Updated)",
  "userCode": "ADM001",
  "email": "admin.updated@college.edu",
  "password": "Password@123",
  "mobileNumber": "9876543210",
  "profilePicturePath": "/Files/Users/admin.png"
}

###

### 6. Delete User (Soft Delete via Service -> Repository)
DELETE {{Lab_25_26_Architecture_HostAddress}}/api/User/Delete/2
Accept: application/json

###
